WEBVTT

54:01.855 --> 54:03.564
You disgusting freaks!

54:04.983 --> 54:07.318
All right, back!
Back, you cannibals!

54:12.073 --> 54:15.743
He is still alive, and you're
not gonna get him, you monsters!

54:15.827 --> 54:17.620
What are you doin'?

54:20.540 --> 54:22.625
Hey. Hey, they fixed you.

54:26.212 --> 54:27.755
But they're cannibals.

54:27.839 --> 54:30.382
We saw them eat
those other toys.
